  "limitations": [
    "Three short current runs on a shared host, no confidence interval or acceptance of performance regressions. Single MSRV run is compatibility evidence, not a cross-compiler speed comparison.",
    "All writers race the same predecessor of one hot machine. This is not independent-instance throughput, a steady stream of successful writers, or an external-worker benchmark.",
